          "a": "It depends on the job. A straightforward opossum job costs less than one that needs full exclusion, cleanup, decontamination, and repair, and typical ranges vary by how many animals are present, how many entry points we have to seal, and how much damage they have done. We quote after we inspect your home, so you see exactly what we found before you decide."
