      "metaTitle": "North Carolina Opossum Removal | WCA-Licensed Local Crew Statewide",
      "metaDescription": "Opossum removal in North Carolina — our licensed Wildlife Control Agent crew inspects first, handles the job under NCWRC rules, and seals entries. Call (844) 544-3498.",
